{"id":780,"imdb":"tt0019254","en":"The Passion of Joan of Arc","orig":"La Passion de Jeanne d'Arc","ar":null,"tag":"An Immortal Screen Classic that will live Forever!","ov":"A classic of the silent age, this film tells the story of the doomed but ultimately canonized 15th-century teenage warrior. On trial for claiming she'd spoken to God, Jeanne d'Arc is subjected to inhumane treatment and scare tactics at the hands of church court officials. Initially bullied into changing her story, Jeanne eventually opts for what she sees as the truth. Her punishment, a famously brutal execution, earns her perpetual martyrdom.","rd":"1928-04-21","rt":81,"g":[18,36],"lang":"fr","budget":0,"revenue":18121,"companies":[{"n":"Société générale des films","logo":null,"c":"FR"}],"countries":["FR"],"langs":["No Language"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"DK","d":"1928-04-21"},{"c":"DE","d":"1928-10-25"},{"c":"FR","d":"1928-10-25"},{"c":"IT","d":"1929-01-18"},{"c":"US","d":"1929-03-28"},{"c":"JP","d":"1929-10-25"},{"c":"GB","d":"1930-01-06"},{"c":"SE","d":"1932-05-09"},{"c":"AU","d":"1952-01-27"},{"c":"ES","d":"1996-04-12"},{"c":"KR","d":"2003-11-20"},{"c":"GR","d":"2025-07-10"}],"dir":["Carl Theodor Dreyer"],"prod":[],"wri":["Carl Theodor Dreyer","Joseph Delteil"],"mus":["Jesper Kyd","Ole Schmidt","Victor Alix","Léo Pouget"],"dop":["Rudolph Maté"],"cast":[{"n":"Maria Falconetti","ch":"Jeanne d'Arc","p":"/zlZX11vxjxukuBW76ZhF11ffPh5.jpg"},{"n":"Eugène Silvain","ch":"Bishop Pierre Cauchon","p":"/a0K5np0UVaFcGKXixA7BCTZ1sXC.jpg"},{"n":"André Berley","ch":"Jean d'Estivet","p":"/w33Urmm5nROsJNWdmQFy0MPcG8r.jpg"},{"n":"Maurice Schutz","ch":"Nicolas Loyseleur","p":"/94drhs4q0P1oTM6kkGT00vDTlw8.jpg"},{"n":"Antonin Artaud","ch":"Jean Massieu","p":"/dIMl6oIhK7Yid3do0dGHQ7Wxjza.jpg"},{"n":"Michel Simon","ch":"Jean Lemaître","p":"/cB7x5hkjMEd2fsVC86tIpEZ9jff.jpg"},{"n":"Jean d'Yd","ch":"Guillaume Evrard","p":"/b9mtziX14RF8wQIZl8DMZ76guN1.jpg"},{"n":"Louis Ravet","ch":"Jean Beaupère","p":"/gixCabXZyuKcJpKJBJT